 rows.append('<details data-name="'+route.lower()+'"><summary><strong>'+route+'</strong><span>'+face+'</span><b>paired evidence passed</b></summary><div class="answers"><section><h3>What changed?</h3><p>The attributed response prevented initiation or interrupted the first paid native step. After scoped correction, the requested movement completed.</p></section><section><h3>How?</h3><p>Two fresh blame experiences formed an approval pattern. A paid correction applied to the exact target. Intermediate content, original obligations and spending were preserved.</p></section><section><h3>What became possible?</h3><p>The resulting native output was consumed: <strong>'+html.escape(result)+'</strong>. The deformed arm had no completed native output.</p></section></div><p class="cost">Admission work: '+str(r['how_changed']['costs']['deformed_admission'])+' deformed / '+str(r['how_changed']['costs']['corrected_admission'])+' corrected. Correction and native execution are separately paid.</p><details class="raw"><summary>Exact references and evidence paths</summary><pre>'+html.escape(json.dumps(r,indent=2))+'</pre></details></details>')
